# Welcome 2 Kigali isolation

This repo is **Welcome 2 Kigali** only.

## Never

- `git push beyond` or any push to `github.com/tefumbole/BeyondTechWorld.git`
- Deploy, rsync, or `git pull` into `/var/www/beyondtechworld`
- Point this app at `beyondtechworld_laravel` or any Beyond database
- Run `tools/deploy-beyondtechworld-*.sh` from this tree

## Always

- GitHub remote for this project: `origin` → `Welcome2Kigali.git`
- Production path: `/var/www/welcome2kigali-app/laravel-app`
- Production database: `welcome2kigali`
- Deploy with `W2K_SSH_HOST=myvps W2K_REMOTE=/var/www/welcome2kigali-app/laravel-app bash tools/deploy-w2k-preview-files.sh`
